msgstr "快速上手"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:124
msgid ""
"The samples run two small Qwen models on one GPU, in the ``default`` "
"namespace. Each claim declares a 6 GiB footprint and a 1 GiB KV floor, so"
" the GPU needs at least 14 GiB, and the Pod requests 16 GiB of host "
"memory. Run the commands from the repository root."
msgstr ""
"示例在 ``default`` 命名空间里用一块 GPU 运行两个小型 Qwen 模型。每个 "
"claim 声明 6 GiB 的占用和 1 GiB 的 KV 下限，因此 GPU 至少需要 14 GiB，Pod "
"还会申请 16 GiB 主机内存。请在仓库根目录下运行这些命令。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:129
msgid "Create the warm pool and wait for its Pod:"
msgstr "创建热池并等待其 Pod 就绪："

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:136
msgid "Create the two claims and watch them start:"
msgstr "创建两个 claim，并观察它们启动："

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:143
msgid ""
"Each claim reads ``Activating`` once it is placed, and ``Active`` once "
"its engine serves. The first start downloads the model, so it can take a "
"few minutes:"
msgstr ""
"claim 被放置后显示 ``Activating``，引擎开始服务后显示 ``Active``。"
"首次启动需要下载模型，可能要几分钟："

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:153
msgid ""
"To send requests through the gateway, keep a port-forward to Envoy "
"running in another terminal:"
msgstr ""
"要通过网关发送请求，请在另一个终端里保持一个到 Envoy 的 port-forward："

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:163
msgid ""
"Then send a request with a claim's ``modelName`` as the model. The "
"``routing-strategy`` header is needed, as `Requests`_ explains:"
msgstr ""
"然后以 claim 的 ``modelName`` 作为模型名发送请求。必须带上 "
"``routing-strategy`` 请求头，原因见 `请求`_："

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:172
msgid "Let idle models sleep by giving the pool a sleep policy:"
msgstr "给热池设置休眠策略，让空闲的模型休眠："

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:179
msgid ""
"Once a model has had no requests for 60 seconds, the controller puts it "
"to sleep, and its claim shows ``Sleeping``. The next request for it gets "
"``503`` with ``Retry-After: 3``, and the gateway requests a wake. Retry "
"after three seconds; the model may still be waking."
msgstr ""
"模型连续 60 秒没有请求后，控制器会让它休眠，其 claim 显示 ``Sleeping``。"
"之后发给它的下一个请求会得到带 ``Retry-After: 3`` 的 ``503``，"
"同时网关请求唤醒该模型。三秒后重试；模型可能仍在唤醒中。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:184
msgid ""
"To clean up, delete the claims first, so that the controller stops their "
"engines:"
msgstr "清理时请先删除 claim，以便控制器停止它们的引擎："

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:193
msgid "Warm pools"
msgstr "热池"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:195
msgid "A warm pool is a Deployment. The sample runs one Pod with one GPU:"
msgstr "热池就是一个 Deployment。示例运行一个带一块 GPU 的 Pod："

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:200
msgid "What its fields do:"
msgstr "各字段的作用："

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:202
msgid ""
"``claim.model.aibrix.ai/pool`` and ``claim.model.aibrix.ai/enabled`` "
"labels"
msgstr ""
"``claim.model.aibrix.ai/pool`` 和 ``claim.model.aibrix.ai/enabled`` 标签"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:203
msgid ""
"Claims select a pool by its ``pool`` label. The controller places claims "
"only on Pods that also have ``enabled: \"true\"``. A claim already on a "
"Pod stays there when the Pod loses either label, until the Pod stops "
"running or is deleted."
msgstr ""
"claim 通过热池的 ``pool`` 标签选择热池。控制器只会把 claim 放置到同时带有 "
"``enabled: \"true\"`` 的 Pod 上。已经在某个 Pod 上的 claim，在该 Pod "
"失去任一标签后仍留在那里，直到 Pod 停止运行或被删除。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:208
msgid "``nvidia.com/gpu``"
msgstr "``nvidia.com/gpu``"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:209
msgid ""
"The number of GPUs in each Pod. A vLLM claim runs only on Pods whose GPU "
"count equals its tensor parallel size times its pipeline parallel size. "
"For a model that needs two GPUs, create another pool whose Pods request "
"two, and give the claim ``--tensor-parallel-size: \"2\"``."
msgstr ""
"每个 Pod 的 GPU 数量。vLLM 的 claim 只会运行在 GPU "
"数量等于其张量并行度乘以流水线并行度的 Pod 上。对于需要两块 GPU 的模型，"
"请另建一个 Pod 申请两块 GPU 的热池，并为 claim 设置 "
"``--tensor-parallel-size: \"2\"``。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:214
msgid "``image``"
msgstr "``image``"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:215
msgid ""
"``aibrix/kvcached-runtime`` contains the runtime agent, vLLM and "
"kvcached, on top of ``ghcr.io/ovg-project/kvcached-"
"vllm:kvcached-v0.1.6-vllm-v0.30.0``. CI publishes it on every push to "
"``main``, tagged ``nightly`` and with the commit's full SHA. With a "
"control plane built from ``main``, use the image of the same commit, "
"pinned by its SHA tag. With ``nightly`` and the sample's "
"``IfNotPresent``, a node keeps the first ``nightly`` it pulled. AIBrix "
"releases do not publish this image. For a release, or for another base "
"image, build the image yourself from a checkout of the commit your "
"control plane runs:"
msgstr ""
"``aibrix/kvcached-runtime`` 包含 runtime agent、vLLM 和 kvcached，基于 "
"``ghcr.io/ovg-project/kvcached-vllm:kvcached-v0.1.6-vllm-v0.30.0`` 构建。"
"CI 在每次推送到 ``main`` 时发布它，打上 ``nightly`` 标签和该提交的完整 "
"SHA 标签。如果控制面是从 ``main`` 构建的，请使用同一提交的镜像，并用 SHA "
"标签固定版本。使用 ``nightly`` 且拉取策略为示例中的 ``IfNotPresent`` 时，"
"节点会一直使用它第一次拉取的 ``nightly``。AIBrix 正式版本不发布这个镜像。"
"对于正式版本或其他基础镜像，请从控制面所用的提交自行构建镜像："

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:232
msgid "``resources.requests.memory``"
msgstr "``resources.requests.memory``"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:233
msgid ""
"Host memory for the runtime agent and its engines. A sleeping engine "
"keeps its model's weights in host memory, so size this for all the Pod's "
"models asleep at once."
msgstr ""
"供 runtime agent 及其引擎使用的主机内存。"
"休眠的引擎会把模型权重留在主机内存里，因此请按该 Pod "
"上所有模型同时休眠的情况来设置。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:237
msgid "``/dev/shm``"
msgstr "``/dev/shm``"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:238
msgid ""
"A memory-backed volume that kvcached and vLLM use to share memory between"
" processes. The sample allows it 16 GiB."
msgstr ""
"一个基于内存的卷，kvcached 和 vLLM 用它在进程之间共享内存。示例为它分配了 "
"16 GiB。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:241
msgid "The ``hf-cache`` volume and ``AIBRIX_WEIGHT_CACHE_DIR``"
msgstr "``hf-cache`` 卷和 ``AIBRIX_WEIGHT_CACHE_DIR``"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:242
msgid ""
"The volume is a directory on the node, mounted at the Hugging Face cache,"
" ``/root/.cache/huggingface``, where engines download their models. A Pod"
" that is recreated on that node therefore does not download them again. "
"``AIBRIX_WEIGHT_CACHE_DIR`` points the runtime agent at the same "
"directory, where it notes the models it has served. The controller "
"prefers Pods that have served a model before."
msgstr ""
"该卷是节点上的一个目录，挂载在 Hugging Face 缓存目录 "
"``/root/.cache/huggingface``，引擎会把模型下载到这里。"
"因此在该节点上重建的 Pod 无需重新下载模型。``AIBRIX_WEIGHT_CACHE_DIR`` 让 "
"runtime agent 也使用这个目录，并在其中记录它服务过的模型。"
"控制器会优先选择服务过该模型的 Pod。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:249
msgid "``/var/run/aibrix``"
msgstr "``/var/run/aibrix``"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:250
msgid ""
"The runtime agent keeps its list of engines here. When the agent "
"restarts, it reads the list and takes its engines back without restarting"
" them."
msgstr ""
"runtime agent 在这里保存它的引擎列表。agent 重启后会读取这份列表，"
"接管原有的引擎，而不会重启它们。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:253
msgid "``ENABLE_KVCACHED: \"false\"`` and ``KVCACHED_AUTOPATCH: \"0\"``"
msgstr "``ENABLE_KVCACHED: \"false\"`` 和 ``KVCACHED_AUTOPATCH: \"0\"``"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:254
msgid ""
"These apply to the runtime agent, which must not load kvcached itself. "
"The agent turns kvcached on in each engine it starts."
msgstr ""
"这两个变量作用于 runtime agent 本身，agent 不能自己加载 kvcached。agent "
"会在它启动的每个引擎中开启 kvcached。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:257
msgid "Other environment variables"
msgstr "其他环境变量"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:258
msgid ""
"Engines inherit the container's environment. Set ``HF_TOKEN`` or "
"``HF_ENDPOINT`` on the container when your models need them."
msgstr ""
"引擎会继承容器的环境变量。如果模型需要，请在容器上设置 ``HF_TOKEN`` 或 "
"``HF_ENDPOINT``。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:261
msgid "``readinessProbe``"
msgstr "``readinessProbe``"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:262
msgid ""
"The Pod is Ready once the runtime agent answers on ``/healthz``. The "
"gateway sends requests only to Ready Pods."
msgstr ""
"runtime agent 在 ``/healthz`` 上有响应后，Pod 就绪。"
"网关只把请求发给就绪的 Pod。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:265
msgid "The metrics Service"
msgstr "指标 Service"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:266
msgid ""
"Its ``aibrix.ai/metrics: modelclaim-runtime`` label and its port named "
"``runtime`` let Prometheus find the runtime agent's metrics. See "
"`Monitoring`_."
msgstr ""
"它的 ``aibrix.ai/metrics: modelclaim-runtime`` 标签和名为 ``runtime`` "
"的端口，让 Prometheus 能找到 runtime agent 的指标。参见 `监控`_。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:270
msgid ""
"Changing the Pod template, for example its image, replaces the Pods. "
"Their engines stop with them, and the controller places their claims "
"again."
msgstr ""
"修改 Pod 模板（例如镜像）会替换 Pod。原 Pod 上的引擎随之停止，"
"控制器会重新放置它们的 claim。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:274
msgid "ModelClaims"
msgstr "ModelClaim 资源"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:276
msgid "The sample claims:"
msgstr "示例中的 claim："

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:285 ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:437
msgid "Field"
msgstr "字段"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:286 ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:438 ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:584 ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:607 ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:628
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:287
msgid "``modelName``"
msgstr "``modelName``"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:288
msgid ""
"The name clients send as ``model``. Defaults to the claim's name. Give "
"each claim its own model name."
msgstr ""
"客户端在请求中作为 ``model`` 发送的名称，默认为 claim 的名称。请为每个 "
"claim 设置不同的模型名。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:290
msgid "``podSelector``"
msgstr "``podSelector``"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:291
msgid ""
"Required. Selects the pool, usually by ``claim.model.aibrix.ai/pool``, "
"among the Pods in the claim's namespace."
msgstr ""
"必填。在 claim 所在命名空间的 Pod 中选择热池，通常按 "
"``claim.model.aibrix.ai/pool`` 选择。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:293
msgid "``artifactURL``"
msgstr "``artifactURL``"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:294
msgid ""
"Required. Where the model comes from, such as "
"``huggingface://Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B``."
msgstr "必填。模型的来源，例如 ``huggingface://Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B``。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:296
msgid "``engine``"
msgstr "``engine``"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:297
msgid "``vllm``, the default, or ``sglang``."
msgstr "``vllm`` 或 ``sglang``，默认为 ``vllm``。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:298
msgid "``replicas``"
msgstr "``replicas``"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:299
msgid "Must be 1, the default."
msgstr "必须为 1，即默认值。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:300
msgid "``priority``"
msgstr "``priority``"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:301
msgid ""
"An immutable non-negative 32-bit placement priority. A higher value gets "
"the next placement opportunity before a lower value when unplaced claims "
"compete for a pool. It defaults to 0 when omitted."
msgstr "未放置的 claim 竞争同一个热池时，值较高的不可变非负 32 位放置优先级会获得下一次放置机会。省略时默认为 0。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:304
msgid "``engineConfig.args``"
msgstr "``engineConfig.args``"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:305
msgid ""
"Engine flags and their values, as strings. An empty string adds a flag "
"without a value."
msgstr ""
"引擎参数及其取值，均为字符串。值为空字符串时，只添加参数本身，不带值。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:307
msgid "``perGPU.maximumFootprint``"
msgstr "``perGPU.maximumFootprint``"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:308
msgid ""
"Needed for placement. The most GPU memory one instance holds on a GPU "
"apart from its KV cache. That covers weights, CUDA graphs, activations "
"and memory the allocator keeps."
msgstr ""
"放置时需要。一个实例在一块 GPU 上除 KV cache 以外占用的最大显存，"
"包括权重、CUDA graph、激活值以及分配器保留的内存。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:311
msgid "``perGPU.kvFloor``"
msgstr "``perGPU.kvFloor``"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:312
msgid ""
"Needed for placement. The KV cache one instance needs on a GPU to serve a"
" single request of its maximum length."
msgstr ""
"放置时需要。一个实例在一块 GPU 上处理一个最大长度的请求所需的 KV cache。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:315
msgid ""
"Only ``perGPU`` can change after a claim is created. To change anything "
"else, delete the claim and create it again."
msgstr ""
"claim 创建后只有 ``perGPU`` 可以修改。要修改其他字段，请删除 claim "
"后重新创建。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:319
msgid "Placement priority"
msgstr "放置优先级"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:321
msgid ""
"``priority`` decides the placement order only for claims that do not yet "
"have an instance. It is a non-negative ``int32``: higher numbers are "
"considered first, and omitting the field means 0. The value is immutable, "
"so create a new ModelClaim to change it."
msgstr "``priority`` 仅决定尚未拥有实例的 claim 的放置顺序。它是非负 ``int32``：数值较高者优先，省略字段即为 0。该值不可变；要修改它，请创建新的 ModelClaim。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:326
msgid ""
"For claims of the same priority that compete for at least one Pod, the "
"controller provides reliable FIFO admission by creation time, then by "
"name. Claims that omit ``priority`` therefore compete at priority 0 with "
"the same deterministic FIFO admission; their order does not depend on "
"which reconcile event happens first. The controller uses BestEffortFIFO: "
"a higher-priority or earlier claim that cannot fit now and cannot make "
"room does not block a feasible claim behind it. Claims that select "
"different pools do not compete."
msgstr "对于竞争至少一个相同 Pod 且优先级相同的 claim，控制器按创建时间、再按名称提供可靠的 FIFO 准入。省略 ``priority`` 的 claim 会以优先级 0 参与竞争，并采用相同的确定性 FIFO 准入；其顺序不取决于哪个协调事件先发生。控制器使用 BestEffortFIFO：当前无法放入也无法腾出空间的高优先级或较早 claim，不会阻塞其后的可行 claim。选择不同热池的 claim 不会竞争。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:334
msgid ""
"With the default ``preemptionPolicy: Never``, priority only chooses which"
" unplaced claim gets the next placement opportunity and does not stop or "
"move an existing instance. Normal placement may still resize KV limits or"
" sleep eligible idle engines to make room. Once a claim has begun making "
"room and holds a valid reservation, it keeps that placement turn until it"
" is placed, releases the reservation, the reservation expires, or the "
"claim is deleted; a later, higher-priority claim cannot take it. Strict "
"priority can starve a low-priority claim when feasible higher-priority "
"claims continue to arrive."
msgstr "使用默认的 ``preemptionPolicy: Never`` 时，优先级仅决定哪个尚未放置的 claim 获得下一次放置机会，不会停止或迁移现有实例。正常放置仍可能调整 KV 限制，或让符合条件的空闲引擎休眠以腾出空间。claim 开始腾出空间并持有有效预留后，会一直保有该放置轮次，直到完成放置、释放预留、预留到期或 claim 被删除；之后到达的更高优先级 claim 不能夺取它。只要可行的高优先级 claim 持续到达，严格优先级可能使低优先级 claim 长期得不到放置。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:343
msgid ""
"A zero-instance claim whose engine could not be activated remains "
"``Failed`` during its activation-failure backoff and does not block a "
"later feasible claim during that wait. When its retry is due, it re-enters "
"admission at its numeric priority and FIFO position; ``Failed`` does not "
"lower its priority."
msgstr "引擎无法激活且没有实例的 claim 在激活失败退避期间保持 ``Failed``，并且在等待期间不会阻塞其后的可行 claim。重试到期后，它会按自身数值优先级和 FIFO 位置重新参与准入；``Failed`` 不会降低其优先级。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:348
msgid ""
"The runtime agent sets ``--model``, ``--served-model-name``, ``--host``, "
"``--port`` and ``--enable-sleep-mode`` itself, so leave them out of "
"``engineConfig.args``. Leave out ``--gpu-memory-utilization`` as well, "
"since kvcached manages the KV cache. A vLLM claim with that flag fails "
"with ``InvalidEngineConfig``. So does one whose parallel sizes are not "
"positive whole numbers, or whose data parallel size is not 1."
msgstr ""
"runtime agent 会自行设置 ``--model``、``--served-model-name``、"
"``--host``、``--port`` 和 ``--enable-sleep-mode``，因此不要在 "
"``engineConfig.args`` 中设置它们。同样不要设置 "
"``--gpu-memory-utilization``，因为 KV cache 由 kvcached 管理。"
"带有该参数的 vLLM claim 会以 ``InvalidEngineConfig`` 失败。"
"并行度不是正整数，或数据并行度不为 1 的 claim 也是如此。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:356
msgid "Declare what a model needs on a GPU"
msgstr "声明模型在一块 GPU 上需要多少显存"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:358
msgid ""
"The controller places a claim only on a Pod whose GPU has room for its "
"``maximumFootprint`` plus its ``kvFloor``. Engines already on that GPU "
"count with their footprints and their KV caches, and each KV cache counts"
" as at least its effective KV floor. With tensor or pipeline parallelism, give the "
"figures for the GPU that holds the most."
msgstr ""
"只有当某个 Pod 的 GPU 能容纳 claim 的 ``maximumFootprint`` 加上 "
"``kvFloor`` 时，控制器才会把 claim 放置到该 Pod 上。该 GPU "
"上已有的引擎按其占用和 KV cache 计算，每个 KV cache 至少按其有效 KV 下限计算。"
"使用张量并行或流水线并行时，请按占用最多的那块 GPU 填写这些数值。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:364
msgid "The controller does not measure models, so measure them yourself:"
msgstr "控制器不会测量模型，请自行测量："

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:366
msgid "Create the claim with generous figures, on a GPU with room to spare."
msgstr "先用宽裕的数值创建 claim，放在空间充足的 GPU 上。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:367
msgid ""
"Send it requests of its maximum length. While it serves them, the runtime"
" snapshot (see `Status`_) shows its engine's GPU memory in "
"``hbm_peak_bytes`` and its KV cache in ``kv_used_bytes``. The footprint "
"is about ``hbm_peak_bytes`` minus ``kv_used_bytes``. ``hbm_peak_bytes`` "
"reads 0 when the runtime agent cannot match GPU processes to the engine. "
"Then use how far the GPU's ``hbm_free_bytes`` fell when the engine "
"started."
msgstr ""
"向它发送最大长度的请求。在它处理这些请求时，runtime snapshot（参见 "
"`状态`_）中的 ``hbm_peak_bytes`` 是该引擎的显存用量，``kv_used_bytes`` "
"是其 KV cache。占用约等于 ``hbm_peak_bytes`` 减去 ``kv_used_bytes``。如果 "
"runtime agent 无法把 GPU 进程对应到该引擎，``hbm_peak_bytes`` 会为 0，"
"这时改看引擎启动时该 GPU 的 ``hbm_free_bytes`` 下降了多少。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:373
msgid ""
"Lower ``maximumFootprint`` to what you measured, with some margin. For a "
"model on one GPU, ``kvFloor`` is about 2 × layers × KV heads × head size "
"× bytes per value × the maximum model length."
msgstr ""
"把 ``maximumFootprint`` 降到测得的值，并留一些余量。对于单 GPU 上的模型，"
"``kvFloor`` 约为 2 × 层数 × KV 头数 × 头维度 × 每个值的字节数 × "
"最大模型长度。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:377
msgid ""
"Declaring more than a model needs wastes room, while declaring less can "
"run the GPU out of memory."
msgstr "声明多于模型所需会浪费空间，声明不足则可能耗尽 GPU 显存。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:380
msgid ""
"A claim without ``perGPU``, or with a figure that is not positive, stays "
"``Pending``, and its ``Scheduled`` condition reads ``InvalidPerGPU``. A "
"claim that is larger than every GPU in its pool stays ``Pending`` with "
"``TooLargeForAnyCard``."
msgstr ""
"没有 ``perGPU``，或其中有非正数值的 claim，会停留在 ``Pending``，其 "
"``Scheduled`` 条件为 ``InvalidPerGPU``。比热池中每块 GPU 都大的 claim "
"会停留在 ``Pending``，原因为 ``TooLargeForAnyCard``。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:386
msgid "Placement and GPU memory"
msgstr "放置与显存"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:388
msgid ""
"A Pod can take a claim when it is in the claim's namespace, matches its "
"``podSelector``, has ``claim.model.aibrix.ai/enabled: \"true\"``, is "
"running with an IP address, and has as many GPUs as the claim needs. The "
"controller places the claim on such a Pod whose GPU has room for it. "
"Among those, it prefers a Pod that has served the model before, since the"
" weights are already on the node. After that, it prefers the Pod with the"
" fewest models awake, then the one with the most room."
msgstr ""
"满足以下条件的 Pod 可以接收 claim：与 claim 在同一命名空间、匹配其 "
"``podSelector``、带有 ``claim.model.aibrix.ai/enabled: \"true\"``、"
"正在运行且有 IP 地址，并且 GPU 数量与 claim 所需相同。控制器会把 claim "
"放置到其中 GPU 有空间的 Pod 上。在这些 Pod 中，它优先选择服务过该模型的 "
"Pod，因为权重已经在节点上；其次选择醒着的模型最少的 Pod，"
"再次选择空间最多的 Pod。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:396
msgid ""
"When no Pod has room, the claim stays ``Pending``. Its ``Scheduled`` "
"condition reads ``NoMatchingPods``, and its message names the Pod that "
"came closest and what it lacks. The controller tries again after 10, 20 "
"and 40 seconds and then every minute. It also tries at once when room may"
" have appeared, for example when another claim is deleted or goes to "
"sleep."
msgstr ""
"如果没有 Pod 有空间，claim 会停留在 ``Pending``。其 ``Scheduled`` 条件为 "
"``NoMatchingPods``，消息中会指出最接近的 Pod 以及它还差什么。控制器会在 "
"10、20、40 秒后重试，之后每分钟重试一次。当可能有了空间时，例如另一个 "
"claim 被删除或进入休眠，它也会立即重试。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:402
msgid ""
"When several unplaced claims can use the same newly available room, "
"priority chooses the first feasible claim as described in `Placement "
"priority`_. A claim that is otherwise feasible but waits for an earlier "
"placement turn stays ``Pending`` with ``Scheduled`` reason "
"``WaitingForPlacementTurn``. This wait does not add placement-refusal "
"backoff."
msgstr "当多个尚未放置的 claim 都能使用同一块新可用空间时，优先级按 `放置优先级`_ 所述选择第一个可行 claim。其他方面可行但在等待更早放置轮次的 claim 保持 ``Pending``，其 ``Scheduled`` 原因为 ``WaitingForPlacementTurn``。这种等待不会增加因放置被拒绝而产生的退避。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:408
msgid ""
"The controller divides each GPU among the engines on it. Each engine "
"keeps its declared footprint and at least its effective KV floor. The rest of the "
"GPU's usable memory goes to the KV caches of the engines that are awake, "
"and the busy ones get more. A GPU's usable memory is its total memory "
"less what the driver reserves. kvcached keeps each engine within its KV "
"limit, which the claim records in ``status.instances[].kvLimitBytes``. "
"The limits change when engines start, stop, sleep or wake, and when the "
"load moves between them."
msgstr ""
"控制器在每块 GPU 上的引擎之间划分这块 GPU。每个引擎保有其声明的占用，"
"以及至少等于其有效 KV 下限的 KV cache。GPU "
"可用显存的其余部分分给醒着的引擎作为 KV cache，繁忙的引擎分得更多。GPU "
"的可用显存是其总显存减去驱动保留的部分。kvcached 让每个引擎不超过它的 KV "
"上限，claim 把这个上限记录在 ``status.instances[].kvLimitBytes`` 中。"
"当引擎启动、停止、休眠或唤醒，以及负载在引擎之间转移时，"
"这些上限会随之变化。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:378
msgid ""
"An engine sizes its KV block pool once, when it starts, and must never be given "
"a KV limit above that size. The runtime agent reports the size as "
"``kv_initial_capacity_bytes`` in its snapshot, and the controller and runtime cap "
"the engine's KV limit at it. Room above the cap stays unassigned. When the size is "
"not known, the field is ``null``. The runtime defers limit writes while startup "
"capacity can still be captured. Writes above a saved but temporarily unverifiable "
"ceiling are deferred for up to five seconds; if verification times out, the "
"previous uncapped fallback applies. When capture is unavailable and no saved "
"ceiling awaits verification, limits remain uncapped."
msgstr ""
"引擎在启动时一次性确定 KV 块池的大小，给它设置的 KV 上限绝不能超过这个大小。"
"运行时代理在快照中以 ``kv_initial_capacity_bytes`` 报告这个大小，"
"控制器和运行时将引擎的 KV 上限限制在这个大小以内。超出该上限的空间保持不分配。"
"大小未知时，该字段为 ``null``。只要启动容量仍可捕获，运行时就会推迟写入 KV 上限。"
"对于已保存但暂时无法验证的容量上限，超过该上限的写入最多推迟五秒；"
"如果验证超时，则沿用之前不施加容量限制的回退行为。无法捕获且没有已保存的上限"
"等待验证时，不施加这一容量限制。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:386
msgid ""
"The effective KV floor is the declared ``kvFloor``, reduced to the startup "
"capacity when that capacity is known, positive and smaller. The controller "
"reports this reduction with a ``KVCapacityBelowFloor`` Warning on the claim."
msgstr ""
"有效 KV 下限为声明的 ``kvFloor``；当已知的启动容量为正数且更小时，"
"将其降低到该启动容量。控制器通过 claim 上的 ``KVCapacityBelowFloor`` "
"Warning 报告这一降低。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:417
msgid ""
"An engine goes on the route only once it is ready and runs within its KV "
"limit. If something else raises an engine's KV limit, the controller sets"
" it back, and keeps the engine off the route until then."
msgstr ""
"引擎只有在就绪并且运行在其 KV 上限之内时，才会加入路由。"
"如果有其他程序调高了引擎的 KV 上限，控制器会把它改回来，"
"并在改回之前让该引擎退出路由。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:422
msgid "Sleep and wake"
msgstr "休眠与唤醒"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:424
msgid ""
"A pool's sleep policy is a JSON annotation on its Deployment, "
"``claim.model.aibrix.ai/pool-policy``, and it applies to every model in "
"the pool:"
msgstr ""
"热池的休眠策略是其 Deployment 上的一个 JSON 注解 "
"``claim.model.aibrix.ai/pool-policy``，作用于热池中的每个模型："

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:439
msgid "``lifecycle.sleepAfterSeconds``"
msgstr "``lifecycle.sleepAfterSeconds``"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:440
msgid ""
"How long a model must be idle before the controller puts it to sleep. A "
"model is idle while it has no request running or waiting. Leave the field"
" out, or set it to 0, to keep models awake unless room is needed. That is"
" allowed only with ``noWakeReserveWhileAsleep``."
msgstr ""
"模型空闲多久后，控制器让它休眠。没有正在运行或等待的请求时，模型即为空闲。"
"不设置该字段或设为 0，则除非需要腾出空间，模型都保持唤醒。这只在开启 "
"``noWakeReserveWhileAsleep`` 时允许。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:444
msgid "``lifecycle.noWakeReserveWhileAsleep``"
msgstr "``lifecycle.noWakeReserveWhileAsleep``"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:445
msgid ""
"``false`` by default, so a sleeping model keeps its room on the GPU. When"
" ``true``, a sleeping model reserves only the GPU memory it still holds, "
"and other models can use the rest."
msgstr ""
"默认为 ``false``，即休眠的模型保留其在 GPU 上的空间。为 ``true`` 时，"
"休眠的模型只预留它仍占用的显存，其余部分可供其他模型使用。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:448
msgid "``lifecycle.sleepToMakeRoomAfterSeconds``"
msgstr "``lifecycle.sleepToMakeRoomAfterSeconds``"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:449
msgid ""
"Used only with ``noWakeReserveWhileAsleep``. How long a model must be "
"idle before the controller may put it to sleep to make room for another "
"model. It defaults to 30 seconds, or to ``sleepAfterSeconds`` if that is "
"shorter. It must be positive, and no longer than ``sleepAfterSeconds`` "
"when that is set."
msgstr ""
"仅在开启 ``noWakeReserveWhileAsleep`` 时使用。模型空闲多久后，"
"控制器才可以为了给另一个模型腾出空间而让它休眠。默认为 30 秒，如果 "
"``sleepAfterSeconds`` 更短，则默认取 ``sleepAfterSeconds``。"
"该值必须为正数，且在设置了 ``sleepAfterSeconds`` 时不能比它长。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:455
msgid ""
"A policy with an unknown field or an invalid value is turned off, and the"
" Deployment gets an ``InvalidPoolPolicy`` Event. The policy also accepts "
"a deprecated ``reclaim`` section, which has no effect on claims that "
"declare ``perGPU``."
msgstr ""
"如果策略含有未知字段或无效值，策略会被关闭，Deployment 上会产生一个 "
"``InvalidPoolPolicy`` Event。策略还接受一个已弃用的 ``reclaim`` 部分，"
"它对声明了 ``perGPU`` 的 claim 不起作用。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:460
msgid ""
"The controller puts a model to sleep once it has been idle for "
"``sleepAfterSeconds``. It first takes the model off the route and checks "
"again that no request is in progress. If one is, the model stays awake. "
"Otherwise, the engine sleeps with vLLM's sleep level 1, which moves its "
"weights to host memory and frees its KV cache for the models that are "
"awake. The claim shows ``Sleeping``."
msgstr ""
"模型空闲达到 ``sleepAfterSeconds`` 后，控制器会让它休眠。"
"控制器先把模型从路由中移除，再确认一次没有正在处理的请求。如果有，"
"模型保持唤醒。否则，引擎以 vLLM 的 sleep level 1 休眠，"
"把权重移到主机内存，并把 KV cache 释放给醒着的模型。claim 显示 "
"``Sleeping``。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:467
msgid ""
"When a request for a sleeping model reaches the gateway, the gateway "
"answers 503 and writes a wake request on the Pod, unless one is there "
"already. The controller then wakes the engine, and puts it back on the "
"route once it is ready. Many requests for one sleeping model cause a "
"single wake. The controller removes the wake request once the model "
"serves, when the wake fails, or after five minutes."
msgstr ""
"当发给休眠模型的请求到达网关时，网关返回 503，并在 Pod "
"上写入一个唤醒请求（如果还没有的话）。控制器随后唤醒引擎，"
"并在引擎就绪后把它重新加入路由。同一个休眠模型的多个请求只会触发一次唤醒。"
"模型开始服务、唤醒失败或过了五分钟后，控制器会删除该唤醒请求。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:474
msgid ""
"By default, a sleeping model keeps its room on the GPU, so that it can "
"wake where it is. Only its KV cache above its effective KV floor goes to the other "
"models on the GPU, and they give it back when it wakes."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，休眠的模型保留其在 GPU 上的空间，以便在原地唤醒。只有其有效 KV "
"下限以上的 KV cache 会分给同一 GPU 上的其他模型，它唤醒时这些模型会归还。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:478
msgid ""
"With ``noWakeReserveWhileAsleep``, a sleeping model reserves only what it"
" still holds on the GPU, which the runtime agent measures after each "
"sleep. The rest can go to other models, so a pool can hold more models "
"than fit awake at once. A model that wakes then needs room again:"
msgstr ""
"开启 ``noWakeReserveWhileAsleep`` 后，休眠的模型只预留它在 GPU "
"上仍占用的部分，这部分由 runtime agent 在每次休眠后测量。"
"其余空间可以分给其他模型，"
"因此热池能容纳的模型可以多于全部醒着时能容纳的数量。这样，"
"模型唤醒时需要重新获得空间："

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:483
msgid "If its GPU has room, it wakes at once."
msgstr "如果其 GPU 有空间，立即唤醒。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:484
msgid ""
"Otherwise, the controller puts other models on the GPU to sleep, the "
"longest idle first and one at a time, until the waking model fits. It "
"takes only models that have been idle for ``sleepToMakeRoomAfterSeconds``"
" and whose claims have the same or a lower priority than the waking "
"model's claim. Meanwhile, the waking model's claim reads "
"``WaitingForRoom``, and each model put to sleep gets a "
"``SleptToMakeRoom`` Event."
msgstr ""
"否则，控制器让同一 GPU 上的其他模型休眠，从空闲最久的开始，每次一个，"
"直到要唤醒的模型能放下。它只会选择已空闲达 ``sleepToMakeRoomAfterSeconds`` 秒，"
"且 claim 优先级与要唤醒模型的 claim 相同或更低的模型。在此期间，要唤醒的模型的 claim 显示 "
"``WaitingForRoom``，每个为此休眠的模型都会得到一个 ``SleptToMakeRoom`` Event。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:489
msgid ""
"If no model can be put to sleep for it, and another Pod has room, the "
"model moves there. A new engine loads it on that Pod."
msgstr ""
"如果没有模型可以为它休眠，而另一个 Pod 有空间，该模型会迁移过去，"
"由新的引擎在那个 Pod 上加载它。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:491
msgid ""
"Otherwise, it waits for room for up to five minutes, and the next request"
" asks again."
msgstr "否则，它会等待空间，最多等五分钟，之后的下一个请求会再次请求唤醒。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:494
msgid ""
"In such a pool, a new claim that no Pod has room for gets room the same "
"way. With the default ``preemptionPolicy: Never``, making room this way "
"does not compare priorities, so an idle model of any priority may be put "
"to sleep for the claim. The controller puts idle models to sleep on one "
"Pod, and the claim's ``Scheduled`` condition reads ``MakingRoom`` until "
"the claim is placed. ``SleepLowerPriority`` uses the same pool safety "
"rules and reservation, but may sleep a strictly lower-priority request-"
"idle engine before the ordinary ``sleepToMakeRoomAfterSeconds`` duration "
"has elapsed."
msgstr ""
"在这样的热池中，没有 Pod 有空间容纳的新 claim 也会以同样的方式获得空间。"
"在默认的 ``preemptionPolicy: Never`` 下，这样腾出空间时不比较优先级，"
"因此任何优先级的空闲模型都可能为该 claim 休眠。"
"控制器让某个 Pod 上的空闲模型休眠，在该 claim 被放置之前，其 "
"``Scheduled`` 条件为 ``MakingRoom``。``SleepLowerPriority`` 使用相同的热池安全规则和预留，但可以在普通 ``sleepToMakeRoomAfterSeconds`` 时长结束前，让请求空闲且优先级严格更低的引擎休眠。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:498
msgid ""
"If the runtime agent cannot measure what a sleeping engine holds, the "
"engine keeps its full room, and its claim gets a "
"``SleepingFootprintUnknown`` Event. While ``noWakeReserveWhileAsleep`` is"
" on, do not wake engines through the runtime agent's API, because such a "
"wake skips the controller's check for room."
msgstr ""
"如果 runtime agent 无法测量休眠引擎仍占用的显存，该引擎会保留其全部空间，"
"其 claim 会得到一个 ``SleepingFootprintUnknown`` Event。开启 "
"``noWakeReserveWhileAsleep`` 时，不要通过 runtime agent 的 API 唤醒引擎，"
"因为这样的唤醒会跳过控制器的空间检查。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:505
msgid "Failures"
msgstr "故障"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:507
msgid ""
"Each engine is a separate process, so a crash stops only that engine. The"
" runtime agent restarts it on the same port after 2, 4, 8, 16 and 32 "
"seconds, up to five times over the engine's life. While it restarts, the "
"model is off the route, and the other models on the Pod keep serving."
msgstr ""
"每个引擎都是独立的进程，因此一个引擎崩溃只会停止它自己。runtime agent "
"会在 2、4、8、16、32 秒后在同一端口上重启它，"
"在引擎的整个生命周期内最多重启五次。重启期间，该模型退出路由，同一 Pod "
"上的其他模型继续服务。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:512
msgid ""
"An engine that crashes again after its fifth restart has failed "
"permanently, and its claim gets an ``EngineFailed`` Event. If another Pod"
" has room, the controller stops the engine and starts the claim there at "
"once. Otherwise, the claim reads ``Failed`` with ``EngineFailed``, and "
"its ``Scheduled`` condition says why it cannot move. The engine's "
"``last_error`` in the runtime snapshot says why it crashed."
msgstr ""
"第五次重启后再次崩溃的引擎即为永久失败，其 claim 会得到一个 "
"``EngineFailed`` Event。如果另一个 Pod 有空间，控制器会停止该引擎，"
"并立即在那里启动 claim。否则，claim 显示 ``Failed``，原因为 "
"``EngineFailed``，其 ``Scheduled`` 条件会说明它为何无法迁移。runtime "
"snapshot 中该引擎的 ``last_error`` 说明了它崩溃的原因。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:519
msgid ""
"If the runtime agent crashes, its engines keep running. The image "
"restarts the agent, which takes the engines back from ``/var/run/aibrix``"
" with their ports unchanged."
msgstr ""
"如果 runtime agent 崩溃，其引擎会继续运行。镜像会重启 agent，agent 从 "
"``/var/run/aibrix`` 接管这些引擎，端口不变。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:523
msgid ""
"If a Pod goes away, its engines go with it, and the controller places "
"their claims again."
msgstr "如果 Pod 消失，其上的引擎随之消失，控制器会重新放置它们的 claim。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:527
msgid "Requests"
msgstr "请求"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:529
msgid ""
"Send requests to the AIBrix gateway with a claim's ``modelName`` as the "
"model, and with a routing strategy, such as the header ``routing-"
"strategy: random``. The gateway can also take a default strategy from its"
" ``ROUTING_ALGORITHM`` environment variable. Without either, it looks for"
" an HTTPRoute for the model, which ModelClaim does not create, and "
"answers 503."
msgstr ""
"向 AIBrix 网关发送请求时，以 claim 的 ``modelName`` 作为模型名，"
"并指定路由策略，例如请求头 ``routing-strategy: random``。网关也可以从其 "
"``ROUTING_ALGORITHM`` 环境变量取得默认策略。两者都没有时，"
"网关会查找该模型的 HTTPRoute，而 ModelClaim 不会创建它，因此会返回 503。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:535
msgid ""
"The gateway sends each request to the engine's port on its Pod, once the "
"engine is on the route, and only while the Pod is Ready. When a model "
"cannot serve, the gateway answers at once instead of holding the request."
" The error message gives the model's state, and the reason when there is "
"one."
msgstr ""
"在引擎加入路由之后，且只在 Pod 就绪时，网关会把每个请求发到该引擎在其 Pod "
"上的端口。当模型无法服务时，网关会立即应答，而不是挂起请求。"
"错误信息会给出模型的状态，有原因时也会给出原因。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:544
msgid "The model is"
msgstr "模型状态"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:545
msgid "The gateway answers"
msgstr "网关的应答"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:546
msgid "starting, failed permanently, or waiting to be placed"
msgstr "正在启动、已永久失败，或等待放置"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:547
msgid "503 with ``Retry-After: 10``"
msgstr "503，带 ``Retry-After: 10``"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:548
msgid "asleep, with no reason, and a wake requested through a Pod binding"
msgstr "休眠中，未给出原因，且已通过 Pod 绑定请求唤醒"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:549
msgid "503 with ``Retry-After: 3``"
msgstr "503，带 ``Retry-After: 3``"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:550
msgid "waiting for room to wake, or getting room made for it"
msgstr "等待空间以便唤醒，或正在为它腾出空间"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:551
msgid "503 with ``Retry-After: 20``"
msgstr "503，带 ``Retry-After: 20``"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:552
msgid "moving to another Pod"
msgstr "正在迁移到另一个 Pod"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:553
msgid "503 with ``Retry-After: 30``"
msgstr "503，带 ``Retry-After: 30``"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:554
msgid ""
"held back by ``InvalidEngineConfig``, ``InvalidPerGPU`` or "
"``TooLargeForAnyCard``"
msgstr ""
"因 ``InvalidEngineConfig``、``InvalidPerGPU`` 或 ``TooLargeForAnyCard`` "
"而无法运行"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:556
msgid "503 without ``Retry-After``, since retrying does not help"
msgstr "503，不带 ``Retry-After``，因为重试没有用"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:557
msgid "unknown to the gateway"
msgstr "网关不认识该模型"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:558
msgid "400"
msgstr "400"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:560
msgid ""
"The gateway picks the delay by the reason first, then by the state, and "
"any other retried case gets 10 seconds. A claim known only from its "
"status, with phase ``Sleeping`` and no reason, gets 10 seconds because "
"the gateway cannot request a wake for it."
msgstr ""
"网关先按原因、再按状态选择重试间隔，其他会提示重试的情况都是 10 秒。"
"仅通过状态为网关所知、阶段为 ``Sleeping`` 且没有原因的 claim 会"
"得到 10 秒，因为网关无法为它请求唤醒。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:566
msgid "Deleting claims"
msgstr "删除 claim"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:568
msgid ""
"When a claim is deleted, the controller first takes it off the route, so "
"the gateway stops sending it requests. It then gives the engine up to 90 "
"seconds from the deletion to finish the requests in progress, and asks "
"the runtime agent to stop it. A sleeping or starting engine is stopped at"
" once. Delete claims before their pool, so that the controller can stop "
"their engines."
msgstr ""
"删除 claim 时，控制器先把它从路由中移除，网关因此不再向它发送请求。"
"然后控制器给引擎最多 90 秒（从删除时算起）处理完正在进行的请求，再请 "
"runtime agent 停止它。休眠中或正在启动的引擎会被立即停止。请先删除 claim，"
"再删除其热池，以便控制器停止它们的引擎。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:575
msgid "Status"
msgstr "状态"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:577
msgid "``kubectl get modelclaims`` shows each claim's phase:"
msgstr "``kubectl get modelclaims`` 显示每个 claim 的阶段："

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:583
msgid "Phase"
msgstr "阶段"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:585
msgid "``Pending``"
msgstr "``Pending``"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:586
msgid "Not placed yet. The ``Scheduled`` condition says why."
msgstr "尚未放置。``Scheduled`` 条件会说明原因。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:587
msgid "``Activating``"
msgstr "``Activating``"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:588
msgid ""
"The engine is starting or restarting, or waits for its KV limit. It is "
"off the route."
msgstr "引擎正在启动或重启，或在等待其 KV 上限生效。此时它不在路由中。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:590
msgid "``Active``"
msgstr "``Active``"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:591
msgid "The engine serves requests."
msgstr "引擎正在提供服务。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:592
msgid "``Sleeping``"
msgstr "``Sleeping``"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:593
msgid "The engine is asleep, and a request wakes it."
msgstr "引擎在休眠，请求会唤醒它。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:594
msgid "``Failed``"
msgstr "``Failed``"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:595
msgid ""
"The engine failed permanently (``EngineFailed``), could not be started "
"(``ActivateFailed``) or is moving to another Pod (``Moving``), or the "
"engine arguments are invalid (``InvalidEngineConfig``)."
msgstr ""
"引擎已永久失败（``EngineFailed``）、无法启动（``ActivateFailed``）"
"或正在迁移到另一个 Pod（``Moving``），"
"或者引擎参数无效（``InvalidEngineConfig``）。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:599
msgid ""
"The ``Scheduled`` condition reads ``Placed`` once the claim has an "
"engine. Until then, it gives one of these reasons:"
msgstr ""
"claim 有了引擎后，``Scheduled`` 条件为 ``Placed``。在此之前，"
"它给出以下原因之一："

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:606 ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:627
msgid "Reason"
msgstr "原因"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:608
msgid "``NoMatchingPods``"
msgstr "``NoMatchingPods``"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:609
msgid "No Pod can take the claim now. The message says why."
msgstr "目前没有 Pod 能接收该 claim。消息中会说明原因。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:610
msgid "``TooLargeForAnyCard``"
msgstr "``TooLargeForAnyCard``"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:611
msgid "No GPU in the pool is large enough for the claim."
msgstr "热池中没有足够大的 GPU 能容纳该 claim。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:612
msgid "``InvalidPerGPU``"
msgstr "``InvalidPerGPU``"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:613
msgid "``perGPU`` is missing or has an unusable figure."
msgstr "缺少 ``perGPU``，或其中有不可用的数值。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:614
msgid "``MakingRoom``"
msgstr "``MakingRoom``"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:615
msgid "Idle models are being put to sleep to make room for the claim."
msgstr "正在让空闲模型休眠，为该 claim 腾出空间。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:616
msgid "``WaitingForPlacementTurn``"
msgstr "``WaitingForPlacementTurn``"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:617
msgid ""
"Another feasible claim has an earlier priority/FIFO placement turn for "
"the same pool."
msgstr "另一个可行 claim 在同一热池具有更早的优先级/FIFO 放置轮次。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:620
msgid ""
"The ``Ready`` condition is ``True`` with ``ModelClaimActive`` while the "
"claim serves. Otherwise, its reason says what holds the claim back:"
msgstr ""
"claim 提供服务时，``Ready`` 条件为 ``True``，原因为 ``ModelClaimActive``。"
"否则，其原因说明是什么让 claim 无法服务："

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:629
msgid "``EngineStarting``"
msgstr "``EngineStarting``"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:630
msgid "The engine is starting or restarting, or waits for its KV limit."
msgstr "引擎正在启动或重启，或在等待其 KV 上限生效。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:631
msgid "``EngineSleeping``"
msgstr "``EngineSleeping``"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:632
msgid "The engine is asleep."
msgstr "引擎在休眠。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:633
msgid "``WaitingForRoom``"
msgstr "``WaitingForRoom``"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:634
msgid "The engine was asked to wake, and its GPU has no room yet."
msgstr "引擎已被请求唤醒，但其 GPU 暂时没有空间。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:635
msgid "``Moving``"
msgstr "``Moving``"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:636
msgid ""
"The engine could not wake where it is, and the claim is moving to another"
" Pod."
msgstr "引擎无法在原地唤醒，claim 正在迁移到另一个 Pod。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:638
msgid "``EngineFailed``"
msgstr "``EngineFailed``"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:639
msgid "The engine failed permanently."
msgstr "引擎已永久失败。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:640
msgid "``ActivateFailed``"
msgstr "``ActivateFailed``"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:641
msgid "The runtime agent could not start the engine. The controller tries again."
msgstr "runtime agent 无法启动该引擎。控制器会重试。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:643
msgid "``InvalidEngineConfig``"
msgstr "``InvalidEngineConfig``"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:644
msgid "The engine arguments are invalid, and the claim has to be recreated."
msgstr "引擎参数无效，必须重新创建 claim。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:645
msgid "``NotPlaced``"
msgstr "``NotPlaced``"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:646
msgid ""
"The claim lost its engine, for example with its Pod, and waits to be "
"placed again."
msgstr "claim 失去了引擎（例如随其 Pod 一起消失），正在等待重新放置。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:649
msgid ""
"Claims also record what happens to them as Events, such as ``Activated``,"
" ``Sleeping``, ``Waking``, ``Woken``, ``KVLimitSet``, ``Rescheduled`` and"
" ``DrainTimedOut``. Priority Sleep additionally records "
"``PreemptedBySleep`` on a victim and ``PreemptionFailed`` on both "
"involved claims when the action fails. The controller's Kubernetes client"
" sends at most 25 Events for a claim in a burst, and then one every five "
"minutes, so a busy claim can miss some. Its phase and conditions stay "
"current."
msgstr ""
"claim 还会以 Event 记录发生在它身上的事情，例如 ``Activated``、"
"``Sleeping``、``Waking``、``Woken``、``KVLimitSet``、``Rescheduled`` 和 "
"``DrainTimedOut``。优先级 Sleep 还会在 victim 上记录 ``PreemptedBySleep``；操作失败时，会在涉及的两个 claim 上记录 ``PreemptionFailed``。控制器的 Kubernetes 客户端对每个 claim "
"在一次突发中最多发送 25 个 Event，之后每五分钟发送一个，因此繁忙的 claim "
"可能会漏掉一些 Event。其阶段和条件始终是最新的。"

