#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:832
msgid "`vLLM sleep mode <https://docs.vllm.ai/en/stable/features/sleep_mode/>`_"
msgstr ""
"`vLLM 休眠模式 <https://docs.vllm.ai/en/stable/features/sleep_mode/>`_"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-claim.rst:833
msgid ""
"`Prism: Cost-Efficient Multi-LLM Serving via GPU Memory Ballooning "
"<https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.04021>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Prism: Cost-Efficient Multi-LLM Serving via GPU Memory Ballooning "
"<https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.04021>`_"

msgid ""
"**No hard preemption.** ``SleepLowerPriority`` is reversible and keeps "
"the victim's instance binding. ``StopLowerPriority`` is not supported; "
"durable drain, stop, restart recovery and victim re-entry are tracked "
"separately in `issue #3154 <https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/aibrix/issues/3154>`_."
msgstr ""
"**不支持硬抢占。** ``SleepLowerPriority`` 是可逆操作，并保留 victim 的实例绑定。"
"目前不支持 ``StopLowerPriority``；持久化的排空、停止、重启恢复和 victim 重新进入机制"
"由 `issue #3154 <https://github.com/vllm-project/aibrix/issues/3154>`_ 单独跟踪。"

msgid "``preemptionPolicy``"
msgstr "``preemptionPolicy``"

msgid ""
"Immutable. ``Never`` (the default) preserves non-preemptive placement. "
"``SleepLowerPriority`` may put request-idle, strictly lower-priority vLLM"
" claims to sleep when this unplaced claim needs GPU room."
msgstr "不可变。默认值 ``Never`` 保持非抢占式放置。未放置的 claim 需要 GPU 空间时，``SleepLowerPriority`` 可以让请求空闲且优先级严格更低的 vLLM claim 休眠。"

msgid "Soft preemption"
msgstr "软抢占"

msgid ""
"Set ``preemptionPolicy: SleepLowerPriority`` on an unplaced claim to let "
"it make room by sleeping lower-priority engines. This replaces ordinary "
"make-room for that claim; it does not fall back to sleeping equal- or "
"higher-priority engines after their normal idle threshold. The field is "
"immutable and defaults to ``Never``. A claim created before this field "
"existed behaves as ``Never``."
msgstr "在未放置的 claim 上设置 ``preemptionPolicy: SleepLowerPriority``，可通过让低优先级引擎休眠来腾出空间。对于该 claim，这会替代普通的腾空流程；即使相同或更高优先级的引擎已经超过普通空闲阈值，也不会回退为让它们休眠。该字段不可变，默认值为 ``Never``。在该字段出现前创建的 claim 按 ``Never`` 处理。"

msgid ""
"A victim must be in the same namespace and on a selected Pod, have a "
"strictly lower numeric priority, and be a vLLM engine whose claim and "
"Runtime state are Active, Alive and Ready. The Runtime snapshot must "
"contain authoritative request metrics with both running and waiting "
"counts equal to zero. A missing metric is never treated as idleness. Pool"
" sleep eligibility still applies; soft preemption requires "
"``noWakeReserveWhileAsleep: true`` and bypasses only "
"``sleepToMakeRoomAfterSeconds``."
msgstr "victim 必须位于同一命名空间和 preemptor 选中的 Pod 上，数值优先级严格更低，并且是 claim 与 Runtime 状态均为 Active、Alive、Ready 的 vLLM 引擎。Runtime snapshot 必须含有权威的请求指标，running 和 waiting 都必须为零。缺失指标绝不会被视为空闲。热池的休眠资格仍然适用；软抢占要求 ``noWakeReserveWhileAsleep: true``，并且只绕过 ``sleepToMakeRoomAfterSeconds``。"

msgid ""
"The planner protects priority before minimizing the number of victims. It"
" considers lower numeric victim priorities first, then idle time and "
"claim name. Across Pods it compares the highest victim priority, the sum "
"of victim priorities, whether sleeping footprints are known, victim "
"count, first idle time, artifact cache and Pod name. Several priority-1 "
"victims therefore beat one priority-90 victim for a priority-100 "
"preemptor."
msgstr "规划器先保护优先级，再减少 victim 数量。它先考虑数值优先级更低的 victim，再按空闲时间和 claim 名称排序。跨 Pod 比较时依次考虑最高 victim 优先级、victim 优先级总和、休眠占用是否已知、victim 数量、首个空闲时间、制品缓存和 Pod 名称。因此，对优先级 100 的 preemptor，多个优先级 1 的 victim 优于一个优先级 90 的 victim。"

msgid ""
"For an unknown sleeping footprint, cross-Pod ranking includes the full "
"optimistic victim prefix needed to make room, even though execution stops"
" at the first unknown victim and replans from its measured footprint."
msgstr "对于未知的休眠占用，跨 Pod 排名会包含按乐观估算腾出空间所需的完整 victim 前缀；实际执行仍会在首个占用未知的 victim 处停止，并根据测得的占用重新规划。"

msgid ""
"The controller reserves the target card for two minutes and sleeps one "
"victim per reconcile pass. When a victim's sleeping footprint is unknown,"
" it sleeps that victim alone, reads a fresh Runtime snapshot, and replans"
" instead of assuming all declared memory was released. The preemptor "
"stays ``Pending`` with Scheduled reason ``MakingRoom`` until physical "
"room is available. Any request-triggered wake whose claim has a strictly "
"higher priority than the preemptor keeps its capacity reserve and is "
"judged by ordinary wake admission. Equal- and lower-priority wakes cannot"
" consume the reserved room until the reservation is released or expires."
" After ordinary wake admission resumes, a waking claim that must make "
"room can sleep only idle neighbours with equal or lower priority; "
"strictly higher-priority claims remain protected. Eligible victims keep "
"the existing longest-idle ordering, followed by claim name. Wake requests"
" retain their existing FIFO ordering relative to one another."
msgstr "控制器为目标卡预留两分钟，并在每次协调中只让一个 victim 休眠。如果 victim 的休眠占用未知，控制器只休眠该 victim，读取新的 Runtime snapshot 后重新规划，而不会假定其声明的全部内存都已释放。在物理空间可用前，preemptor 保持 ``Pending``，Scheduled 原因为 ``MakingRoom``。claim 优先级严格高于 preemptor 的请求触发唤醒会保留其容量预留，并按普通唤醒准入接受判断。相同或更低优先级的唤醒在抢占预留释放或过期前不能占用该空间。恢复普通唤醒准入后，需要腾出空间的唤醒 claim 只能休眠优先级相同或更低的空闲邻居；严格更高优先级的 claim 仍受保护。符合条件的 victim 继续按最长空闲时间排序，若相同则按 claim 名称排序。唤醒请求之间继续沿用现有的 FIFO 顺序。"

msgid ""
"No cross-claim ownership is stored in Status. After a controller restart,"
" an already sleeping victim remains authoritative in Runtime and claim "
"Status; the preemptor measures the current card and establishes a new "
"reservation if more room is needed. A Sleep failure releases the "
"reservation, leaves the victim's authoritative state unchanged, and "
"enters ordinary placement backoff so another feasible waiting claim can "
"proceed."
msgstr "Status 中不存储跨 claim 所有权。控制器重启后，已经休眠的 victim 仍以 Runtime 和 claim Status 为权威；preemptor 会测量当前卡，并在仍需空间时建立新预留。Sleep 失败会释放预留、保持 victim 的权威状态不变，并进入普通放置退避，让另一个可行的等待 claim 继续。"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Successful victims receive a ``PreemptedBySleep`` Event. A failed action "
"emits ``PreemptionFailed`` on both claims. Controller metrics count "
"bounded outcomes in "
"``aibrix_modelclaim_preemption_attempts_total{policy,result,reason}`` and"
" ``aibrix_modelclaim_preemption_victims_total{action,result}``; object "
"names, namespaces, Pod names and UIDs are deliberately absent from these "
"labels."
msgstr "成功的 victim 会收到 ``PreemptedBySleep`` Event。操作失败会在两个 claim 上发出 ``PreemptionFailed``。控制器通过 ``aibrix_modelclaim_preemption_attempts_total{policy,result,reason}`` 和 ``aibrix_modelclaim_preemption_victims_total{action,result}`` 统计有界结果；这些标签特意不包含对象名、命名空间、Pod 名称和 UID。"

msgid ""
"``aibrix_modelclaim_preemption_attempts_total``, by bounded policy, "
"result and reason; and"
msgstr "``aibrix_modelclaim_preemption_attempts_total``，按有界的策略、结果和原因统计；以及"

msgid ""
"``aibrix_modelclaim_preemption_victims_total``, by bounded action and "
"result."
msgstr "``aibrix_modelclaim_preemption_victims_total``，按有界的动作和结果统计。"
